.el .ds Aq '
.TH PDFLUENT-DOCTOR 1  "pdfluent 1.1.0" PDFluent
.SH NAME
pdfluent\-doctor \- Check environment / installation and print build info
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpdfluent doctor\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fIINPUT\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check environment / installation and print build info
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Machine\-readable JSON envelope on stdout
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Quiet: human mode prints data only (no warnings or progress notes)
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Verbose stderr diagnostics (repeat for more)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
[\fIINPUT\fR]
PDF file to inspect for decode\-leniency events (optional)
.SH VERSION
v1.1.0
